# Document History

## Purpose

The Document History records the revision history of the Atlas Handbook throughout its lifecycle.

Maintaining a documented history of changes supports traceability, governance, quality assurance, and continuous improvement. Each official release of the handbook shall include an updated revision history to provide readers with a clear understanding of the evolution of the document.

